  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-46ef05a3c819beb35374f9",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "1-3回合：1级只拿弈星走连败，3回合竞拍米莱狄 > 蒙恬 > 项羽 > 鬼谷子。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 20,
          "paragraph_end": 20
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-a9fadf5d14f830f171a68a",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "4-7回合：棋手升4级后，开始搜牌，凑齐阵容中的米莱狄、项羽、蒙恬、鬼谷子、大司命、太乙真人，压力不大可以升5级再找大司命，概率更高。7回合竞拍大司命 > 鲁班大师 > 太乙真人。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 21,
          "paragraph_end": 21
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-336ba86bacd3efb43d5457",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "8回合以后：棋手升5级找鲁班大师，凑齐阵容中的所有英雄，阵容成型，后续就是慢慢觉醒阵容中的所有英雄，遇到加等级的效果牌可以拿，优先给大司命，例如阵营祝福、八方来援、精密协作等。11回合竞拍可以拿扶摇直上、众星闪耀、破境之证、能量超新星。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 22,
          "paragraph_end": 22
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c90bff18dbb6a1c6109822",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "这套阵容总体思路围绕大司命这张牌构筑：大司命的效果是召唤往生图腾，并且在触发牺牲效果时往生图腾等级永久+2并获得50点法力值（往生图腾法力值满时变成山鬼）。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-ef22c6f2dcc423ed5a4b8e",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "项羽、蒙恬、鬼谷子的玄微之种提供牺牲效果，项羽牺牲不仅能增加图腾等级还能让召唤物免疫控制。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-50a7d8f1fe54b47148953b",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "往生图腾会吸收1-3阶己方召唤物，每吸收一个山鬼等级永久+1并获得法力值，米莱狄和蒙恬提供召唤物。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-0b27a02a3aa2ef4afb8630",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "鲁班大师的机关傀儡会获得召唤单位最高等级的一半作为临时等级，觉醒会获得召唤单位全部等级作为临时等级，当山鬼999级时，觉醒的鲁班大师的机关傀儡也会达到999级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-6c9559d8d767e9f3d73d71",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "玩山鬼如果拿到升格，山鬼存活8s后会变成大司命，但是本体大司命不会再召唤往生图腾变成山鬼了，山鬼变成的大司命会继承山鬼等级，释放技能时会召唤敌人的灵体协助战斗，最多可以召唤5个大司命，但强度不如山鬼。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-9ca71f767ca7fa2760d68f",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "如果拿到巨像，山鬼无法吸收巨像召唤的红蓝buff怪，红蓝buff属于4阶召唤物。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-4a44f56502a133f4740939",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "有机关秘典可以拿，机关匣可以召唤2个1阶故障机器人，视为召唤物，山鬼会吸收故障机器人并获得法力值。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 11,
          "paragraph_end": 11
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5237137b953a81f4ae2a1c",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "太乙真人复活效果最好给项羽，每回合可以增加两次图腾的等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5644b13abd14ab2eb106e1",
      "section": "推荐天赋及原因",
      "text": "金色天赋灵祭升华和生生不息优先获取，往生图腾变成山鬼时会触发灵祭升华效果；生生不息能让山鬼和机关傀儡获得复生效果。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-294186d8ed48eee21f5ada",
      "section": "推荐天赋及原因",
      "text": "优先选择增加能量，图腾相关或者找牌的天赋，优先选择大河精兵（4-5阶大河流域英雄3选1）、灵祭升华、命运图腾（召唤一个图腾和击败图腾的敌方英雄1换1）、熊魂附甲（穿戴2件装备的大河英雄阵亡召唤一个和自身等级相同的熊灵）。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 15,
          "paragraph_end": 15
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-8994a52861f270be5dbadb",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "大司命装备推荐：铸梦·逐风、名刀·司命、不死鸟之眼；米莱狄装备推荐：法源之杯、自然法杖、破茧之衣。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-9b1edfde23390c66ae032c02084dd02d2cf10471db12ae99c1f050ffce438090",
          "paragraph_start": 18,
          "paragraph_end": 18
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-8c4787226d17ee1b676191",
      "section": "定阵条件",
      "text": "材料没有明确绑定棋手，本篇只保存已讲清的阵容共通操作；棋手专属技能与升级差异待确认，不把正文提及的英雄当成棋手。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
